%% CrestFlow - SDLC Model (report level)
%% Type: iterative-incremental lifecycle view
flowchart LR
  P1["1 Planning<br/>requirements and decisions"] --> P2["2 Design<br/>architecture and schemas"]
  P2 --> P3["3 Implementation<br/>iterative increments"]
  P3 --> P4["4 Testing<br/>unit, integration, testnet"]
